  "question": {
    "text": "The halides which can react with water or undergo hydrolysis are<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
